{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b8a42c9e3be9234e92b426a2e0eb7709f621a3b9c15b2464c84e30f39d286123", "ja": "（無事に初公演を終えた星梨花の次のステップとして、\n今日はあいさつ回りをすることにした）", "zh": "（作为顺利结束初次公演的星梨花接下来的安排，今天决定去各处拜访致意。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "013b8a76a991f937d96284249fcdf70b658a87532a016669584ef3135a17464b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nあいさつ回りって何をするんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n拜访打招呼是要做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a9a63dfcb1841e285967d6cd6d1f41c5ef955d62c312faaab3b256d4107c44d7", "ja": "これから一緒に仕事をしたい人と話をして、\n星梨花のことを知ってもらうって感じかな。", "zh": "和今后想一起合作的人聊聊天，让他们了解星梨花，大概就是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "729967dc2cb101e437a6a59b5addb550e4292ef7cec58d234e69ecfa1c57bd03", "ja": "じゃあ、いろんな人とお話ができるんですね！\nわたし、楽しみです！", "zh": "那么，就能和各种各样的人聊天了吧！\n我很期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f1a07810e7ac759d1180c290b7712115cd53b745122f72147abaa8b2ef3b1f88", "ja": "そうだな。しっかりアピールして、\n顔と名前を覚えてもらおうな。", "zh": "没错。要好好展现自己，让大家记住我们的长相和名字。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "24c7f6815cd6502ec1ca09283264458f24202b83ca3d340cfd2abe5021194161", "ja": "はい、がんばります！", "zh": "好的，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "39e577963244c3888458408bec8ae19feaa944836e457a20e8586de63b24ef74", "ja": "わぁ……！\nここで、テレビの撮影をしてるんですね。", "zh": "哇……！\n原来是在这里进行电视节目的拍摄啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "31ab3a8154c0248ab9e9e38903e72a3ab7850e79002dc4ddfbb03768d989f431", "ja": "カメラって、こんなにたくさんあるんだ……。\nでも、画面に流れるのは、ひとつだけですよね？", "zh": "原来摄影机有这么多台啊……\n不过，画面上播放的只有一个，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1009_p", "source_sha256": "462ab82134e3885ebfb5efc25a9edf26bb05c5a560e4d1050950312eb57777ea", "ja": "スイッチャーさんというお仕事があるんだ。\nその部屋で、映る画面を切り替えてるんだよ。", "zh": "原来还有切换师这样的工作啊。\n他们会在那个房间里切换要播放的画面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "fe103aaca9ac62769b3066e9b3aebaa5a40931ba3482b8079ed563ed19d3c529", "ja": "そうなんですね！\nテレビ局って、知らないことがいっぱいです！", "zh": "原来是这样啊！\n电视台里有好多我不知道的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e6a6984e2f974ec43a1fb4054ec85f3a5a1c152af210d4f0f82d4356c3d87532", "ja": "せっかくだし、あいさつ回りが終わったら\nテレビ局内を見学させてもらおうか。", "zh": "难得来一趟，等拜访完之后，\n去参观一下电视台内部吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1b620550b04000ecb3e7038b9658576904610b43aa84cd1c8d864eaac73c5093", "ja": "あっ、あの人は……。", "zh": "啊，那个人是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "b19011222ea84edcc055f74650e06944a7810ef0e637e29be0a8359792994d07", "ja": "？　{$P$}さんの、\nお知り合いですか？", "zh": "？　您是{$P$}先生认识的人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8887321f05fab46300be8e3839c1df708831c591175b3a577a3089ffa6933750", "ja": "音楽番組のプロデューサーさんだよ。\n早速あいさつを……あ、でも忙しそうだな。", "zh": "是音乐节目的制作人。先去打个招呼……啊，不过他好像很忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "59f8445fe933575043bbdb8d2f44250ac4c00600aa1391fe7ed71045644f93ef", "ja": "わたし、行ってきます！", "zh": "我去打个招呼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1016_p", "source_sha256": "43da3397c3127317713a95b176181468b5aec10c7fed60f585f5a27ea73076c6", "ja": "あっ、星梨花！？", "zh": "啊，星梨花！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "b8163da19dafd44c76f59998ccc3cbdec1c61f0ae85e50d7dc02a95939eb542a", "ja": "こんにちは、はじめまして！", "zh": "你好，初次见面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1018_bangumiproducer", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "f3feb8b2d19460eeb252c3abb0cebd182433c98d9a4a235d09694d10f50ae1fb", "ja": "わたし、新しく765プロのアイドルになった、\n箱崎星梨花っていいます！　あの……。", "zh": "我叫箱崎星梨花，是刚加入765Pro的偶像！那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1020_bangumiproducer", "source_sha256": "7ffbe4fd1c98fbd1740eaf707d3a23c5e8d4e039ce479356df4566978db094cc", "ja": "そう、自己紹介ありがと。\n今打ち合わせ中だから、後にしてくれる？", "zh": "对，谢谢你的自我介绍。\n我现在正在开会，能晚点再说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "c112e837ec3210eee0be1523172c55d20511121c250414290d73798dc388c5a1", "ja": "えっ？\nあ、えっと……。", "zh": "诶？\n啊，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1022_p", "source_sha256": "9dabb3db0b03a7e25d86f439afcdf017325c50b576f5354df87053fa91ac7964", "ja": "お忙しいところ、すみませんでした。\n星梨花、あいさつは改めてな。", "zh": "您正忙着，真是不好意思。\n星梨花，问候的话下次再正式说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "6da27636600fa4e1339cc6fbbd91ca3ce8e74054bc16d6f5f065b5437d933c55", "ja": "はい……ごめんなさい。", "zh": "是……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4b494b3337c0f41b4bca43a602c080656e1925c15cf3f371e56ac4579726c83a", "ja": "（星梨花、今まであんな風に邪険に扱われた事が\nなかったんだろうな。かなり戸惑っている……）", "zh": "（星梨花以前大概从没被那样冷淡地对待过吧。她相当不知所措……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "99705e05da4353bea50b775ec5a3a7bf8fbd59d6f308f2f79f31db97f1945d83", "ja": "さっきの番組プロデューサーさん、\nわたしの顔、ちゃんと見てくれませんでした……。", "zh": "刚才那位节目制作人先生，都没有好好看我的脸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1028_p", "source_sha256": "01442858973719dd40f705c91f4f4b9b9e534f6c837113249a260f68f9589eff", "ja": "仕事の打ち合わせ中だったからな。\nタイミングが悪かったんだよ。", "zh": "因为当时正在商量工作嘛。\n只是时机不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1029_p", "source_sha256": "a802d60b8dce253fb20bb703d3eff8dcabcbcc9ad00f99a17e4e2d881f34fb59", "ja": "それに、星梨花はまだ売り出し中の新人だ。\n誰にでも話を聞いてもらえるわけじゃない。", "zh": "而且，星梨花还是正在努力闯荡的新人。\n不可能谁都愿意听她说话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "38317e5060f30b868c47d65695c0185a5ceba5cc8bf2c17481d076a4961ee0dd", "ja": "じゃあ、どうしたら、\nわたしを見てもらえるんでしょうか？", "zh": "那么，要怎么做才能让大家注意到我呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "e31a7c7ddfe794d3003ff4ea4292224b50c4e1b645b9506bc7e5d3b0d46b0243", "ja": "ちゃんとあいさつをして、\nわたしのこと、知ってもらいたいです！", "zh": "好好打招呼，让大家了解我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1032_p", "source_sha256": "690017860f2b1a55571e3925f0a884acb1d497430800817239f5375f5c4df0ff", "ja": "そうだな。その気持ちは伝わるはずだ。\n打ち合わせが終わった頃に、もう一度行ってみようか。", "zh": "是啊。这份心意一定能传达给大家。\n等商谈结束后，我们再去一次吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1035_bangumiproducer", "source_sha256": "88ecd64d505f6678ebd64c8dde563b2aeb20c0225cbc1b6b8388992528a1032f", "ja": "……それじゃみなさん、本番はそんな感じで。\nよろしくお願いしますね！　はい、解散！", "zh": "……那么各位，正式演出时就照这个感觉来。\n拜托大家了哦！好，解散！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1036_p", "source_sha256": "48c01ba274e402d09f4ea4ee748008bf27d0dbb02d393fafcde0cc84d5f7fa1b", "ja": "すみません、先ほどは失礼しました。\n今、お時間いいですか？", "zh": "抱歉，刚才失礼了。\n现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1037_bangumiproducer", "source_sha256": "7c683b20bd5b23488e48b44104c733339c8cf57cf90c9fcbbdca346c21cbfb35", "ja": "ああ、{$P$}Pさん。\nうん、もう終わったから大丈夫よ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}P先生。\n嗯，已经结束了，没事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1038_022ser", "source_sha256": "a2500c9903b0ac609160ba2b8b593cfa599b8c41f32312a71b7e88d00d3b10ae", "ja": "あの……は、はじめまして！\nわたし、765プロの箱崎星梨花っていいます！", "zh": "那个……初、初次见面！\n我是765事务所的箱崎星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1039_022ser", "source_sha256": "5da2aec56185f657d6c090a76e78b37694b82bc7772ce93d58f438f883968e5d", "ja": "まだアイドルを始めたばかりですけど、\n一生懸命がんばりますので、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "虽然我才刚开始当偶像，但我会努力加油的，请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1040_bangumiproducer", "source_sha256": "89b6009ec6104ba9d6470c42e504d16a1c18dfcd4029d7a9649a8cf6bb221bda", "ja": "おっ、元気でいいわね！　765プロさんか～。\nこれからよろしくね、星梨花ちゃん。", "zh": "哦，看起来很有精神，真不错呢！原来是765制作人先生啊～。\n接下来请多关照啦，星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1041_022ser", "source_sha256": "fdcdd7f0e60fbfde754059b0f1c1f0d6d1852bef4612a7010aee42b42f0de89f", "ja": "あ……ありがとうございます！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "啊……谢谢您！\n今后请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1043_022ser", "source_sha256": "b569a118d1af6824d8514059a4743d864a168e39337770d4ed9736c55ea62133", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n今度はちゃんと聞いてもらえました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n这次对方好好听我说话了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1044_p", "source_sha256": "6c39accdfa0c7d351239ba7010b6a7d1aaf2e79e6b4af4f759f5aeb7ae975bdb", "ja": "ああ、よかったな！\n星梨花の事も、覚えてもらえたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "啊，那就好！\n他们应该也记住星梨花了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1045_022ser", "source_sha256": "28ec63e9bc249d4d451a4b3a5bd482578b5561f4626747c615e44ba0ea81ec85", "ja": "はい！　あいさつも、タイミングが大事なんですね。\n勉強になりました！", "zh": "是的！打招呼也很讲究时机呢。\n我学到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_004_1046_022ser", "source_sha256": "c5ca7be95ae4cd37f3b3128374751afaa304b6fd5eda3e63a83993029bb1e006", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n次の人に、あいさつしに行きましょう！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n我们去向下一位问好吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
